   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "I want and I would like",
     "texto": [
      "**Θέλω** means «I want». To order politely you can say **Θα ήθελα…** («I would like…»), a useful fixed expression. **Έναν** goes with a masculine noun, **μία** with a feminine one and **ένα** with a neuter one: **έναν καφέ, μία πορτοκαλάδα, ένα νερό**.",
      "**Παρακαλώ** at the end of the order means «please»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
